/DipanProj_MapEditor/Assets/StreamingAssets/Effects.meta

# DipanProj_MapEditor — 購買的原始特效包（大量二進位素材，各自留本機，不進版控）
/DipanProj_MapEditor/Assets/Resources/Super Pixel Effects Gigapack/
/DipanProj_MapEditor/Assets/Resources/Super Pixel Effects Gigapack.meta

# DipanProj_Main — Sync Map Assets 從 GameAssets 產生的衍生素材副本，不進版控（打包前先跑一次 Sync）
